Certification 1 — Microsoft AI-900: Azure AI Fundamentals
Provider: Microsoft
Best fit profiles: AI Compliance and Ethics Consultant, AI Strategy Consultant, AI Implementation Consultant, Freelance AI Consultant, AI Venture Builder
Why it matters: Vendor-neutral entry-level certification recognised broadly across enterprise employers. Validates understanding of AI and ML concepts, Azure AI services, and responsible AI principles. Exam: 40–60 multiple-choice questions, ~60 minutes, passing score ~700/1000. Preparation: Microsoft Learn AI-900 free learning path, 2–4 weeks at ~2 hours per day.

Certification 2 — IAPM Certified Agile Project Manager
Provider: IAPM
Best fit profiles: AI Transformation Lead, AI Implementation Consultant, AI Trainer and Enablement Specialist, AI Product Manager
Why it matters: Validates Scrum, Kanban, XP, user stories, sprint planning and agile team leadership. Valid for life, no recertification required, no project experience required for admission. Exam: 120 multiple-choice questions, 80 minutes, passing score 65%. Preparation: IAPM free web-learning platform, 2–4 weeks at ~1–2 hours per day.

If the top profile match appears in both lists (e.g. AI Implementation Consultant), include both certifications and instruct the candidate to pick one. Otherwise include only the certification whose best fit profiles include the top profile match.

