- learning.selective_reading: minimum 4 items ordered by priority. Include at least one build_your_own_lab entry. Type must be one of: read_books | read_articles | self_paced | build_your_own_lab. For read_books: describe the thematic territory of books to explore — do not name specific titles. For read_articles: describe the type of publications and article themes to follow — do not name specific articles. For self_paced: name the course type and platform category, not a specific course. For build_your_own_lab: give a concrete hands-on project description specific to this candidate's niche and top profile match. Books and articles must appear as separate items with their own type — do not combine them into a single entry.
- All actions must be specific. "Update LinkedIn" is not acceptable. "Rewrite your LinkedIn headline to read: [positioning_statement.headline from Part 1]" is.

