- Every free action must follow the format: [action] — powered by [Strength] — addresses [SWOT element]
- need_now.free_action: exactly one action. Specific to this candidate's niche and best profile.
- have_runway.free_actions: exactly 4 actions in the order specified.
- part_time.free_actions: exactly 4 actions, each different, each grounded in this candidate's niche.
- All actions target landing in the best profile in the right environment — defined by career_anchors.top3, hard_avoids, and working_style.
- recommended_scenario: for this candidate — active_search + direct_path + proof of work = need_now.
- swot_rooting fields must reference specific items from this candidate's actual SWOT — not generic observations.

